      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RORY'S REVENGE (3) ran on too late after settling back from a wide gate at Ascot nearly 3 weeks ago, finishing sixth. He gets a big swing with his starting position this time, and he gets another chance to show his true worth. On top. SOUTH HOBA (4) took luck out of the equation when leading all the way at Northam 9 days ago, scoring an impressive win by over 4 lengths. A similar front running performance would make him hard to peg back again. POINT ROCKS (5) is very capable on his day, and he will appreciate a 3kg claim here. If his mind is on the job, then he is definitely capable of taking this out. REGAL SERVICE (2) will find this easier than his first couple of starts back from a spell, and from a superior gate, a form reversal is on the cards. Each way value. COSMIC CHAOS (1) can do better, so keep him safe if any money comes for him.",
